{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫趁即將迎來台慶，今午安排近百位旗下小生花旦陳豪、陳展鵬、馬國明、羅子溢、張曦雯、龔嘉欣、高海寧、陳煒、陳曉華及戴祖儀等等雲集於西九戲曲中心參與《TVB邁向60年節目巡禮2027》。</p><p>隨着劇集製作步入寒冬期，今日僅得8套重點劇納入推介名單上</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.067577+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:25:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"2f4be965d349c2b1b89700f43dc58b4be60359db61c5aa258206c7e51b89a04c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}